# Docker build exclusions (T-105 in batch 11).
#
# Keep the build context small: target/ alone is hundreds of GB on
# cold rebuilds with the ort + lancedb stack (line-tables-only helps
# but cannot shrink transitive deps). `.git/` is irrelevant for builds;
# `.atl/` and `.opencode/` are session-local state.

# Build artifacts
target/
**/target/

# VCS
.git/
.gitignore

# Tooling session state
.atl/
.opencode/

# Local docs / scratch (not needed by the binary)
docs/
benches/

# Node / JS (the Docker image does not need anydoc at build time; the
# host can mount Node from outside if it wants the 14 document formats)
node_modules/
*.node
